"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdatabricks_monolith=self.webpackChunkdatabricks_monolith||[]).push([[17082],{194701:a=>{a.exports=JSON.parse('{"language":"French","languageCode":"FR","totalCourses":6,"courses":[{"id":"13119","title":"Databricks Fundamentals Accreditation - French","body":{"processed":"<p>Bienvenue \xe0 l\'accr\xe9ditation Databricks Fundamentals. Dans ce quiz de 20 questions, nous allons tester vos connaissances sur la plateforme de Data Intelligence Databricks. Si vous compl\xe9tez ce quiz avec succ\xe8s, vous recevrez un badge (dans les 48 heures) par l\'interm\xe9diaire de notre fournisseur de badges, Accredible. Bonne chance !</p><p><br></p><p><span>Languages Available:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2308/databricks-fundamentals-accreditation?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=fd879ea1bf1dfe5011ac33d9abdd51ce94468e76\\"><span>English</span></a><span>&nbsp;|</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2337/datbricks-fundamentals-ren-ding-databricks-fundamentals-accreditation-japanese?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=160a96bcb442dbfe5ddf7a46575f4b6094518815\\"><span>日本語</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2338/certificacao-fundamentos-databricks-databricks-fundamentals-accreditation-portuguese-br?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=c05a6ba962382ac585326707\\"><span>Portugu\xeas BR</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2765/databricks-fundamentals-accreditation-korean?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=d907fb417ca35a28a814c864323b27829f799e83\\"><span>한국어</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/3664/databricks-fundamentals-accreditation-spanish?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=c054e4e71da0a602bbabd645fbf394731b3ce286\\"><span>Espa\xf1ol</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/3716/databricks-fundamentals-accreditation-french?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=221dd3d52599adb4886ed52179d4a427a4821ef6\\"><span>Fran\xe7ais</span></a></p>"},"duration":1800,"skillLevel":{"entity":{"name":"Introductory"}},"cost":{"entity":{"name":"Free"}},"role":null,"type":[{"entity":{"name":"Academy"}}],"entityUrl":{"path":"/fr/training/catalog/databricks-fundamentals-accreditation-french-3716"},"price":"0.00","includesLabs":false,"instructorLed":false},{"id":"13120","title":"Databricks Fundamentals - French","body":{"processed":"<p>Ce cours est con\xe7u pour tous ceux qui recherchent une introduction fondamentale \xe0 Databricks et au Databricks Data Intelligence Platform. Tout au long de ce cours, on vous pr\xe9sentera les diff\xe9rentes fonctionnalit\xe9s et produits propos\xe9s dans le cadre de la plateforme et pourquoi ces fonctionnalit\xe9s et produits sont pr\xe9cieux pour toutes les entreprises qui cherchent \xe0 exploiter la puissance de leurs donn\xe9es et de leurs ressources IA pour acc\xe9l\xe9rer leur activit\xe9.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Ces vid\xe9os sont fournies dans un ordre sugg\xe9r\xe9, mais vous pouvez les regarder dans l’ordre que vous pr\xe9f\xe9rez. De plus, nous vous recommandons de regarder tout le contenu vid\xe9o disponible avant de tenter l’\xe9valuation d’accr\xe9ditation pour Databricks Fundamentals.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Veuillez noter que nous ne pr\xe9sumons d’aucune connaissance technique pr\xe9alable de Databricks ou des plateformes de gestion de donn\xe9es.</p><p><br></p><p><span>Languages Available:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2206/databricks-fundamentals?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=6e9bc723e91c60e263c7fcc743ea72b4070af445\\"><span>English</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2298/databricks-fundamentals-japanese?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=b696180843eec75a48dc2d33ce7e0b2e4e779603\\"><span>日本語</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2299/databricks-fundamentals-portuguese-br?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=7da9f81fa6e4287a3c451eb7a3f6671d78dafd36\\"><span>Portugu\xeas BR</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2752/databricks-fundamentals-korean?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=c8563a4ea29296ee48acd8fde1d643e6cd884656\\"><span>한국어</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/3644/databricks-fundamentals-spanish?generated_by=626380&amp;hash=513a15ec36b0dfc30688075ade0d74b648aa6ea0\\"><span>Espa\xf1ol</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/3715/databricks-fundamentals-french?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=76878893678b8c5e1452077b29292a12e6df5fcc\\"><span>Fran\xe7ais</span></a></p>"},"duration":3600,"skillLevel":{"entity":{"name":"Introductory"}},"cost":{"entity":{"name":"Free"}},"role":null,"type":[{"entity":{"name":"Academy"}}],"entityUrl":{"path":"/fr/training/catalog/databricks-fundamentals-french-3715"},"price":"0.00","includesLabs":false,"instructorLed":false},{"id":"13061","title":"Generative AI Fundamentals Accreditation - French","body":{"processed":"<h4>Bienvenue \xe0 la Databricks IA g\xe9n\xe9rative Fundamentals - Accr\xe9ditation</h4><p><br></p><p>Il s’agit d’une \xe9valuation de 10 minutes qui testera vos connaissances des concepts fondamentaux li\xe9s \xe0 l\'IA g\xe9n\xe9rative.&nbsp;</p><p>Apr\xe8s avoir r\xe9ussi cette \xe9valuation, vous recevrez le badge Databricks Generative AI Fundamentals.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Parcours d’apprentissage</strong></p><ul><li>Cette accr\xe9ditation fait partie du plan d’apprentissage Databricks Generative AI Fundamentals.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Preuve d’ach\xe8vement</strong></p><ul><li>\xc0 partir d’un taux de r\xe9ussite de 80 %, vous recevrez un badge de Databricks.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><span>Languages Available:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/1811/generative-ai-fundamentals-accreditation?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=4b0d0c91df3b234cd5e9fa36e8d1fc1d43fb8f71\\"><span>English</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2311/generative-ai-fundamentals-accreditation-japanese?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=d0918b0062a317be08a7469a857aa1b9b7aecee0\\"><span>日本語</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2310/generative-ai-fundamentals-accreditation-portuguese-br?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=230eb24bbe7d7393d0f1cf67b774acfba793a85a\\"><span>Portugu\xeas BR</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2784/generative-ai-fundamentals-accreditation-korean?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=0875ccc07f2116b9088bbd8d7fe80652cc522dd8\\"><span>한국어</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4284/generative-ai-fundamentals-accreditation-french?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=a90bcf7693bf3a325f002e07780dec14deb9ef34\\"><span>Fran\xe7ais</span></a></p>"},"duration":600,"skillLevel":{"entity":{"name":"Introductory"}},"cost":{"entity":{"name":"Free"}},"role":{"entity":{"name":"Generative AI Engineer"}},"type":[{"entity":{"name":"Academy"}}],"entityUrl":{"path":"/fr/training/catalog/generative-ai-fundamentals-accreditation-french-4284"},"price":"0.00","includesLabs":false,"instructorLed":false},{"id":"13062","title":"Generative AI Fundamentals - French","body":{"processed":"<p>Ce cours fournit une introduction \xe0 la fa\xe7on dont les organisations peuvent comprendre et utiliser les mod\xe8les d’intelligence artificielle g\xe9n\xe9rative (IA). Tout d’abord, nous commencerons par une introduction rapide \xe0 l\'IA g\xe9n\xe9rative - nous discuterons de ce qu’elle est et accorderons une attention particuli\xe8re aux grands mod\xe8les de langage, \xe9galement connus sous le nom de LLM. Ensuite, nous aborderons la mani\xe8re dont les organisations peuvent r\xe9ussir avec l\'IA g\xe9n\xe9rative - nous approfondirons ce que sont les applications LLM, discuterons de la fa\xe7on dont Lakehouse AI peut vous aider \xe0 r\xe9ussir et discuterons des consid\xe9rations essentielles pour l’adoption de l\'IA en g\xe9n\xe9ral. Enfin, nous aborderons les aspects importants \xe0 prendre en compte lors de l’\xe9valuation des risques et des d\xe9fis potentiels associ\xe9s \xe0 l’utilisation/adoption de l\'IA g\xe9n\xe9rative.</p><p><br></p><p><span>Languages Available:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/1765/generative-ai-fundamentals?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=35bad7cecfac6c3263bdd6bf43124c931e01f414\\"><span>English</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2251/generative-ai-fundamentals-japanese?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=a974a3f256410317ec9f55dd11937e6f53b3fedb\\"><span>日本語</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2252/generative-ai-fundamentals-portuguese-br?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=c5ce1f9e9078adf0e08eccebc72d812793aa2d63\\"><span>Portugu\xeas BR</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/2780/generative-ai-fundamentals-korean?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=4518d510dfdcc2202e0498f858151a4f0331f3df\\"><span>한국어</span></a><span>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4283/generative-ai-fundamentals-french?generated_by=471122&amp;hash=bc186ae04cf47449d67e4cb216640bb60d94cd5b\\"><span>Fran\xe7ais</span></a></p>"},"duration":7200,"skillLevel":{"entity":{"name":"Introductory"}},"cost":{"entity":{"name":"Free"}},"role":{"entity":{"name":"Generative AI Engineer"}},"type":[{"entity":{"name":"Academy"}}],"entityUrl":{"path":"/fr/training/catalog/generative-ai-fundamentals-french-4283"},"price":"0.00","includesLabs":false,"instructorLed":false},{"id":"12991","title":"AI/BI for Data Analysts - French","body":{"processed":"<p>Dans ce cours, vous apprendrez \xe0 utiliser les fonctionnalit\xe9s que Databricks fournit pour les besoins de veille \xe9conomique : Tableaux de bord AI/BI et AI/BI Genie. En tant qu\'analyste de donn\xe9es Databricks, vous serez charg\xe9 de cr\xe9er des tableaux de bord AI/BI et des espaces g\xe9nie AI/BI au sein de la plateforme, de g\xe9rer l\'acc\xe8s \xe0 ces actifs par les parties prenantes et les parties n\xe9cessaires, et de maintenir ces actifs au fur et \xe0 mesure de leur modification, de leur actualisation ou de leur mise hors service au cours de leur dur\xe9e de vie. Ce cours vise \xe0 enseigner aux participants comment concevoir des tableaux de bord pour obtenir des insights, les partager avec les collaborateurs et les parties prenantes et maintenir ces actifs au sein de la plateforme. Les participants apprendront \xe9galement \xe0 utiliser AI/BI Genie Spaces pour prendre en charge l\'analyse en libre-service gr\xe2ce \xe0 la cr\xe9ation et \xe0 la maintenance de ces environnements optimis\xe9s par le moteur d\'intelligence des donn\xe9es Databricks.</p><p><br><span>Languages Available:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/3707/aibi-for-data-analysts?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=3bc4ff56f15348015c749ea6b40547d77d7a6319\\"><span>English</span><span>&nbsp;</span></a><span>|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4187/aibi-for-data-analysts-japanese?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=5e1dbb3c9939173dcd6419720a78026dd19c1d9d\\"><span>日本語&nbsp;</span></a><span>|</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4195/aibi-for-data-analysts-portuguese-br?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=daedbd983d1320c4c0675e6d3b1ef029b38ac244\\"><span>&nbsp;Portugu\xeas BR</span><span>&nbsp;</span></a><span>|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4200/aibi-for-data-analysts-korean?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=10d6ba06309dc524d1df10952372569bfa13ae33\\"><span>한국어</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><span>|</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4249/aibi-for-data-analysts-spanish?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=eb1d7c0d105fb9ac305a4f9bf9e94ea61fcad4c2\\"><span>Espa\xf1ol</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><span>|</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4245/aibi-for-data-analysts-french?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=6269b8295b43b73b8468162942540040930fe490\\"><span>fran\xe7aise</span></a></p>"},"duration":7200,"skillLevel":{"entity":{"name":"Associate"}},"cost":{"entity":{"name":"Free"}},"role":{"entity":{"name":"Data Analyst"}},"type":[{"entity":{"name":"Academy"}}],"entityUrl":{"path":"/fr/training/catalog/aibi-for-data-analysts-french-4245"},"price":"0.00","includesLabs":false,"instructorLed":false},{"id":"12990","title":"AI/BI for Data Analysts - French","body":{"processed":"<p>Dans ce cours, vous apprendrez \xe0 utiliser les fonctionnalit\xe9s que Databricks fournit pour les besoins de veille \xe9conomique : Tableaux de bord AI/BI et AI/BI Genie. En tant qu\'analyste de donn\xe9es Databricks, vous serez charg\xe9 de cr\xe9er des tableaux de bord AI/BI et des espaces g\xe9nie AI/BI au sein de la plateforme, de g\xe9rer l\'acc\xe8s \xe0 ces actifs par les parties prenantes et les parties n\xe9cessaires, et de maintenir ces actifs au fur et \xe0 mesure de leur modification, de leur actualisation ou de leur mise hors service au cours de leur dur\xe9e de vie. Ce cours vise \xe0 enseigner aux participants comment concevoir des tableaux de bord pour obtenir des insights, les partager avec les collaborateurs et les parties prenantes et maintenir ces actifs au sein de la plateforme. Les participants apprendront \xe9galement \xe0 utiliser AI/BI Genie Spaces pour prendre en charge l\'analyse en libre-service gr\xe2ce \xe0 la cr\xe9ation et \xe0 la maintenance de ces environnements optimis\xe9s par le moteur d\'intelligence des donn\xe9es Databricks.</p><p><br></p><p><span>Languages Available:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/3702/aibi-for-data-analysts?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=1cf4f11f8f6cc43b4e07e7c6a3ebf5d6faac5e29\\"><span>English&nbsp;</span></a><span>|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4188/aibi-for-data-analysts-japanese?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=441eacfdd64ea39a360248c68e7bd549b5462f52\\"><span>日本語&nbsp;</span></a><span>|</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4194/aibi-for-data-analysts-portuguese-br?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=609c3e5e3b9e823e308122cf53b443247a0d8f08\\"><span>&nbsp;Portugu\xeas BR&nbsp;</span></a><span>|&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4199/aibi-for-data-analysts-korean?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=7945da88d0b92d77703f9608e754e1391afbbc3b\\"><span>한국어</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><span>|</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4250/aibi-for-data-analysts-spanish?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=31372b9311b394da865b1ecbd73811b3481fc565\\"><span>&nbsp;Espa\xf1ol</span></a><span>|</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\\"https://customer-academy.databricks.com/learn/course/4244/aibi-for-data-analysts-french?generated_by=981615&amp;hash=beae4a171fe371c0ad6d19d161dd59cfbb78d6e7\\"><span>fran\xe7aise</span></a></p>"},"duration":10800,"skillLevel":{"entity":{"name":"Associate"}},"cost":{"entity":{"name":"Paid & Subscription"}},"role":{"entity":{"name":"Data Analyst"}},"type":[{"entity":{"name":"Academy"}}],"entityUrl":{"path":"/fr/training/catalog/aibi-for-data-analysts-french-4244"},"price":"75.00","includesLabs":true,"instructorLed":false}]}')}}]);
